1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,297
Naya phone 20 hazaar ka, aur logon ki jeb mein 5 hazaar.

2
00:00:04,597 --> 00:00:10,049
Faizan, yahi mauka hai! Purane phone khareed, theek kar, aur warranty ke saath bech!

3
00:00:10,349 --> 00:00:13,090
Second-hand phone pe log bharosa karenge?

4
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:19,707
Bill, checking report aur chhe mahine ki warranty de, to zaroor! Dedh lakh ka stock kaafi hai.

5
00:00:20,007 --> 00:00:26,173
Chori ka phone kabhi mat lena. Har phone ka IMEI check kar, aur ID ki copy rakh.

6
00:00:26,723 --> 00:00:30,773
Bhaiya, college ke liye achha phone chahiye, par budget 10 hazaar hai.

7
00:00:31,073 --> 00:00:35,345
Ye dekho, ekdam naya jaisa. 8 hazaar, chhe mahine ki warranty!

8
00:00:35,645 --> 00:00:40,227
Ek phone pe 2 hazaar tak munafa. Roz do phone, yaani 4 hazaar.

9
00:00:40,527 --> 00:00:44,877
Online bhi bech, aur purane phone ke badle exchange offer chala.

10
00:00:45,177 --> 00:00:48,236
Purana maal, naya kamaal! Faizan ki life set!
